      <chord name="C"/>All <chord name="F"/>hail the power of <chord name="C"/>Je<chord name="Dm"/>sus&#x27; <chord name="C"/>name! <chord name="F"/>Let <chord name="C7"/>an<chord name="Dm"/>gels <chord name="F"/>pros<chord name="C7"/>trate <chord name="F"/>fall;<br/>
