      <chord name="F"/>Bring forth the royal <chord name="C"/>diadem, <chord name="Dm"/>and <chord name="F"/>crown <chord name="Bb"/>Him <chord name="F"/>Lo<chord name="C7"/>rd of <chord name="F"/>all.
