      <lines>
      <chord name="C"/>Ye <chord name="F"/>chosen <chord name="C"/>seed <chord name="Dm"/>of <chord name="C"/>Israel&#x27;s <chord name="F"/>race, <chord name="C7"/>ye <chord name="Dm"/>ransomed <chord name="F"/>from <chord name="C7"/>the <chord name="F"/>fall,<br/>
